@startuml
title JoySong AI Agent 高效混合路由主流程

hide footbox
autonumber
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 100
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8

actor 用户 as User
participant "AI页面" as App
participant "Chat API" as API
participant "ChatService" as Chat
participant "上下文解析" as Context
participant "IntentRouter" as Router
participant "轻量LLM解析" as Parser
participant "CatalogService" as Catalog
participant "DiscoverSearch" as Search
participant "SafetyService" as Safety
participant "PlanService" as Plan
database "JoySong DB" as DB
participant "回答LLM" as LLM

== 理解与路由 ==
User -> App: 发送问题
App -> API: 提交消息
API -> Chat: sendMessage()
Chat -> DB: 保存消息并读取短历史
DB --> Chat: 最近对话
Chat -> Context: 补全当前查询
Context --> Chat: contextualQuery
Chat -> Router: assess(query, contextType)
Router --> Chat: LocalAssessment

note over Router,Parser
|= 返回内容 |= 可选值 |
| intent | GENERAL_CHAT · CATALOG_QA · COMPARISON · PLANNING · DETAIL_SUMMARY · SAFETY_SCREENING |
| target | INSTITUTION · DOCTOR · PROJECT · INSTITUTION_PROJECT |
| action | NONE · SHOW_CATALOG · START_PLANNING · COMPLETE_SAFETY_SCREENING |
| assessment | confidence · ambiguityReasons · requiresLlmParsing |
end note

alt 高可靠度且无冲突
    Chat -> Chat: 使用本地决策
else 低可靠度或复杂问题
    Chat -> Parser: 解析意图、目标和关键词
    Parser --> Chat: intent + target + keywords
    Chat -> Chat: 校验或回退本地决策
end

== 意图执行 ==
alt GENERAL_CHAT
    Chat -> Chat: 不查询目录
else SAFETY_SCREENING
    Chat -> Chat: 停止推荐；action=风险筛查
else PLANNING
    opt target不为空
        Chat -> Catalog: 查询规划参考资料
        Catalog -> Search: search(query, target)
        Search -> DB: 查询候选数据
        DB --> Search: 搜索结果
        Search --> Catalog: 分类结果
        Catalog --> Chat: 参考资料
    end
    Chat -> Chat: action=开始规划
else DETAIL_SUMMARY
    Chat -> DB: 按contextType/contextId查询
    DB --> Chat: 详情及关联资料
else CATALOG_QA或COMPARISON
    Chat -> Catalog: promptEvidence(query, target)
    Catalog -> Search: 统一关键词搜索
    Search -> DB: 按target查询
    DB --> Search: 分类数据
    Search --> Catalog: 搜索结果
    Catalog -> Catalog: 去重、排序、限量
    alt COMPARISON
        Catalog -> Catalog: 保留同类型；生成报告
    else CATALOG_QA
        Catalog -> Catalog: 生成发现页卡片
    end
    Catalog --> Chat: 数据证据 + 卡片/报告
end

== 回答与下一步 ==
Chat -> LLM: 生成一次简短回答
LLM --> Chat: 回答内容
Chat -> DB: 保存AI回复
Chat --> API: message + intent + target + action + cards/report
API --> App: 返回本轮结果

alt action=风险筛查
    App --> User: 展示风险筛查入口
    User -> App: 填写并确认
    App -> Safety: 提交结构化筛查
    Safety -> DB: 读取档案并评估
    DB --> Safety: 档案数据
    Safety --> App: 风险等级 + nextAction
else action=开始规划
    App --> User: 展示规划入口
    User -> App: 确认档案和筛查
    App -> Safety: 风险评估
    Safety --> App: 评估结果
    opt 允许创建规划
        App -> Plan: createPlan()
        Plan -> DB: 读取数据并保存规划
        DB --> Plan: 档案与项目
        Plan --> App: 分阶段规划
    end
else 无结构化动作
    App --> User: 展示回答、卡片或报告
end
@enduml
